              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baria abamwabo Yeria nigo barenge chilifu ibere, na amagana atano na abere (2,700), abateneneri be chiamate chiabo, bamanyete korwana esegi buya. Barabwo Daudi omorwoti akababeeka bakaba abateneneri b’abaanto b’egesaku kia Rubeni, na ab’ekia Gadi, na ab’ekeng’ese ki’egesaku kia Manase, ase emeremo ende yonsi ya Nyasae na ey’omorwoti.",
